i would heartily recommend taming - in my ascenscion (singular :-{) i must have
tamed several dozen creatures, with the magic harp, spellbook of charm monster
(learnt a couple of times) and some scrolls of taming. it, together with a
magic whistle (to get them close to you) lessens the numbers of monsters that 
can attack you at once, and gives you a path out of there by being able to
be displaced and also killing some of the other monsters. both uncursed and 
blessed scrolls tame all adjacent monsters (unless they are the wiz!)

